attachments ||--o{ transaction_attachments

note bottom of users
  Tables with user_id reference users.id.
  Most user-owned rows use ondelete CASCADE in the models.
end note

note right of resource_relations
  Application-level polymorphic relation.
  from_type/from_id and to_type/to_id are indexed,
  but are not declared as database foreign keys.
end note

@enduml
